WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.630
You'll catch a cold, Takao.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.490
Professor!

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:42.090
Tomorrow, the Ceremonial Match begins.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:45.120
If you get sick, you'll miss the match, you know.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.660
Those guys sure were strong...

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:49.080
You mean Ivan?

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:53.260
I didn't think anyone so
strong would be in the abbey.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.220
Yeah.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.050
But that's not what's keeping you up, is it?

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:03.270
I assume you're worried about other matters.

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:05.260
Uh-huh.

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:08.860
When are you coming back, Kai?

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:14.310
The Nightmarish Ceremonial Match

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.200
He's late...

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.210
I overslept!

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:27.040
Seriously... when are you gonna quit oversleeping?

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.570
All because you stayed up so late!

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:32.260
If we don't hurry on, we'll miss the match.

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:34.980
Sorry, sorry! It's all my fault.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.660
Now, let's get a move on.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:42.970
Something wrong?

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.240
Oh, nothing...

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:45.860
Is it Kai?

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:49.940
I bet he doesn't even know
about the Ceremonial Match...

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:53.540
We've no time to worry. He'll be back soon.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.090
What in the world..?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:18.530
This battle dome looks like a temple.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:24.190
The Volkov Battle Dome was built
through donations from the Volkov Abbey.

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:30.820
Mr. Volkov used it to present Beys
as a symbol of peace and friendship.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:34.120
Awful nice of him, but a whole dome?

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.330
Makes you think.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.440
Hey!

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.290
Hey, you made it!

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:44.350
Today's the day.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:44.890
Yes.

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:48.250
Bear witness to the newfound
strength of the White Tiger Clan.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.540
What the heck is that weird smell?

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.900
Hamburgers and cola, huh?

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.460
What? Where?! I wanna have some!

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.580
Mama!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:58.970
Good morning, Max.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:01.010
You're all in this, too?

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.960
We'll be on shortly.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:07.720
The match between us and
the Russian Team is about to start.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.800
The Russian team?

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.320
Are they different from the team at the Abbey?

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.530
We caught word this morning.

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:18.320
The Volkov Abbey's team is
the team that's representing Russia.

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.270
They're representing Russia?

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:28.080
Guess that explains their strength!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.750
We don't know all too much about the Russians,

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.950
but we'll score an easy win collecting data.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:37.740
You may have beaten us
in the American tournament,

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:41.230
but now we can show you
the true extents of our power.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.350
Watch and see.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.420
Russia is tough!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.630
Don't let your guard down!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.560
<i>Don't worry!</i>

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.740
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:03.490
Welcome to Mr. Volkov's Beyblade select match!

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:09.590
This is a Beyblade festival put together by
Mr. Volkov to promote everlasting world peace!

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:17.300
Between America, China, and Russia,
a fiery battle is about to begin!

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:19.130
Of course he's here...

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:23.300
It's not even official, but he
really will show up anywhere...

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:29.570
As you know, the upcoming World Championship
finals will be held right here in Russia!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:35.580
Today's Ceremonial Match marks a
premiere event, celebrating our opening!

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:41.570
We'll be using today's matches to turn up the heat on the Finals!

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:46.720
Now, then! I've been practicing for this very day!

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:49.160
Behold, my performance!

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:56.140
My, my, that's the ever-distant Russia for you!

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:58.130
It's as cool as ever!

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:00.670
No, the only thing that's cold around here is you...

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:04.170
Now, let's get on with the match!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:09.610
But before we begin, Mr. Volkov
will kick it off with a few words!

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:18.440
Thank you all so much for coming.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:25.000
I'm pleased to be holding this
Ceremonial Match ahead of the finals.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.940
I cannot contain my excitement

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:32.140
for the many wonderful
battles that will soon begin.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:37.510
However, ladies and gentlemen,
there is something we cannot possibly forget.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:41.550
Anger and hatred will never win Beybattles.

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:48.180
Passionate friendship and everlasting bonds
borne from heated battle, a benevolent spirit...

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.890
That itself is the essence of Beyblade.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.610
Beys are a symbol of love and friendship.

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:58.980
Beybattles are peace and
co-operation working as one.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.360
May God bestow divine protection unto all Bladers!

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:08.310
Now, with such an excellent speech wrapped up,

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:10.560
it's time to introduce our Bladers!

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:14.460
They continue to aim for the
top with their advanced sciences—

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.200
the Sport Elite team—

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.340
America's PPB team takes to the arena!

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:26.420
What's with the awkward silence?

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.720
No one in here's clapping!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:33.710
It must be because the PPB is the away team.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:35.360
There's nothing we can do about it.

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:36.850
Screw that.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.650
You can do it!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.940
Mama! <i>Good luck</i>!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:44.470
And now, it's time for the ones
you've all been waiting for!

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:50.130
Today's combatant! The first person
to show off Russia's strength will be...

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.100
Ivan Papov!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:55.600
Oh, so they'll root for the Russian team...

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.440
Tough crowd, huh?

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:00.160
And they're gonna come out one-by-one...

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:04.550
I get the feeling everyone,
including DJ, is on Russia's side here.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.320
Ceremonial Match, first match of the first set!

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:12.010
Ivan will be facing
Steve from the PPB Team!

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.810
Don't let your guard down
just because he's small, Steve...

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:16.350
He's pretty skilled.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:17.970
Let's have a good match, kid.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:19.690
I know you.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.870
Although the PPB team
relies heavily on science,

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.760
You're the most block-headed
Blader out of the bunch.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:28.080
Why, you...

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:29.860
Let's get started!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:30.990
Ready?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.240
Three! Two! One!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.030
Go... Shoot!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:50.310
With that, the battle has finally begun!

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:53.310
Who's going to claim victory first?!

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.920
Steven! Collect data, right away.

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:57.570
Keep it light for now.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.900
Okay.

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:00.430
Here we go, Tryhorn!

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:07.410
Whoa! Wyborg easily dodged Tryhorn's attack!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.680
You jerk!

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:15.350
Wyborg slithers along the arena!

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:17.950
It's like a snake, creeping across the ground!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.250
That strafing..!

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.310
Tryhorn moves in a straight line,

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:24.970
so it won't be able to stop that Bey from moving!

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:29.410
But it can't turn in for
a head-on attack, either.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.970
Movements like that
won't win you the match.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.210
Its attack, defense, and endurance...

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:37.440
At this rate, we won't learn anything!

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:39.230
A strategy that avoids sharing data...

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.580
Can you do anything
other than run away?

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:43.520
Huh, kid?!

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:45.980
Darn you...

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:47.550
Tryhorn!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.470
What?!

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:00.090
Tryhorn is out!

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:01.850
Ivan is the winner!

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.520
That attack instantly dealt the final blow!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:07.890
It's just like a snake's bite!

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:12.740
Like I told you...

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.800
You're a blockhead!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.840
I didn't think he'd have
that kind of destructive power...

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:22.850
He wasn't serious back
when he battled with you, then.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.700
S-Sorry.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:27.620
Emily, could you analyze that attack?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.860
Yes, about that...

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.280
Assessing the damage Tryhorn took,

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:33.780
that Bey's destructive power...

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:37.920
exceeds that of any other we've gone up against!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.160
What?

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:44.540
When simulating this last battle, the
Russian team's potential energy...

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:45.920
I-Incredible!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.380
How could these numbers..?

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.650
The Russian team has won the first set!

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:55.600
Partaking in the second set will be
none other than the PPB Team's Eddy!

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:57.230
Eddy.

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.870
No need to test them.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.780
Go all-out from the very start.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.200
Yes, sir!

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:07.450
And here we have the one regarded as
the strongest of the Russian Team...

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:11.420
This boy! Yuriy Ivanov
takes to the stadium!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:16.990
That's him.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:20.770
Listen up, Eddy.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.620
Finish this ASAP.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.120
Understood.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.960
I'll show them what we're really made of.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:30.180
Will the Russian team end this in an instant?

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:32.880
Or will the PPB manage to get even?

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.960
Here we go! Ready?

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:37.420
Three! Two! One!

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:39.590
Go... Shoot!

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.890
Sting Shoot!

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:53.800
What?!

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:14.500
Trypion is out!

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:16.740
Yuriy is the winner!

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:18.880
Unbelievable!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:23.280
He blew back Eddy's fierce
special move instantaneously!

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:26.400
Such overwhelming power!

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:27.600
<i>Khorosho!</i>

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.820
You're kidding me.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.440
I-Impossible!

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.320
I can't believe it.

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.200
Our scientific knowledge
has no effect on them...

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:42.060
What's that? The PPB isn't
all it's cracked up to be!

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:44.240
The PPB isn't weak.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.400
Russia's just too strong.

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:49.710
If we aren't careful,
we'll meet the same fate.

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:51.390
What even happened back there?

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.850
The heck did he do?

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:56.930
It was so fast I couldn't tell what happened.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.270
The difference in power is too big.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:01.310
What kind of Ceremonial Match is this?

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:02.180
It's merely...

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:06.720
It's a demonstration match rigged
to show off Russia's strength!

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.040
Precisely.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:13.370
We'll show them the power of Russia by
using the PPB and Chinese Teams as a sacrifice.

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:17.150
That's the true goal of this Ceremonial Match.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.620
But we still have a few tricks up our sleeve.

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.590
And here comes the main event.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:31.010
Now, as we move toward a one-sided finale...

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:33.870
Will the PPB team show their tenacity?

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:37.420
Or will Russia go on for their third win?

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:40.030
The one to bring us into
the final battle will be

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.910
the PPB team's Michael!

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:47.640
And on the Russian team, the third player is...

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:06.010
W-What kind of twist is this?!

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:10.530
Russia's third member will be the BBA Team's strongest player!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.880
Kai Hiwatari has entered the ring!

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:15.010
Kai's on the Russian team?!

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.430
But how?!

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:18.420
How...

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.920
Why's Kai over there?

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:23.500
Takao!

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.820
What do you think you're doing, Kai?

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:39.880
You're on the BBA team.
Why are you with the Russian team?

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:40.560
Step aside.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.630
Kai!

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:54.320
K-Kai...

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.300
What's Kai's problem?

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:58.590
Kai... what happened to you?

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:01.600
I don't know... but what I do know is,

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.470
I can't accept this!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.300
Stick to the plan.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:14.570
Hey now, when did
you go and change teams?

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:21.660
It's fine. I don't hold back,
no matter who my opponent is.

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:23.520
For the honor of the PPB—

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.820
It won't be all that interesting
if you're my only opponent.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:26.880
What?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:29.240
All of you come at me at once.

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:31.120
All of you!

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:32.230
What?!

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:33.620
All of us, at the same time?!

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:37.250
Kai-kun, don't be crazy.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.840
Beyblade's for one-on-one battles.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.420
No matter how strong you are—

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:43.470
Keep your mouth shut.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:51.140
There's no helping it.
The Ceremonial Match's third set

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:54.570
will be an unprecedented
irregular match between Kai

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.350
and the rest of the PPB Team!

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.350
He's taking them all on by himself?!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:00.360
He's lost it!

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:04.040
I didn't think he'd show up on the Russian team,

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.440
let alone challenge the entire PPB with him.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:11.420
He can't take them all on,
no matter how strong he is...

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:15.340
Something's definitely not right.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:16.370
How reckless.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.920
What are you trying to pull, Kai?

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:25.990
He's mocking us.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:30.950
Let's give him what he wants,
and take him on altogether.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:32.360
Steve! Eddy!

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:33.340
Director.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:35.280
I'll partake as well.

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:36.480
Emily...

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:40.350
I didn't get to analyze Kai's ability
back in the American tournament.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:43.640
If I can't do so with a machine,
then I'll do so in practice!

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:50.080
Ignoring the rules, this third
set will be an all-out deathmatch!

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:53.730
Fight until there's a winner!

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:54.360
Ready?

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:07.260
Look! Kai's not using Dranzer!

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:09.350
What is that deep-black Bey?

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.330
Three!

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:17.260
Two!

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:17.880
One!

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:20.620
Go Shoot!

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:36.290
Let's do it!

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:47.740
This is it.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:56.340
But how?!

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:01.060
This is what I wanted.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.070
No way...

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.730
Go, Trygator!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.610
The ultimate power.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.510
The ultimate moment.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.420
And...

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:34.300
Here we go, Trygle!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.920
Cannonball...

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.490
Maximum...

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:38.780
Arm!!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:47.820
Black Flame Saber!!

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:01.460
What?!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.140
This is what I've been aiming for.

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:18.910
The ultimate battle.

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:26.460
Kai...

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:28.430
Do it.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:12.140
The weak...

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:14.480
do not deserve to yield Sacred Beasts.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:18.140
The Sacred Beasts are a symbol of strength!

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:25.490
I will obtain all Sacred Beasts!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.600
And with them...

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:34.420
I will become the greatest Blader in the world.

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.130
The Sacred Beasts...

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.810
The PPB's Sacred Beasts...

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.670
have been absorbed into Kai's Bey!

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:40.420
But how?!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.890
I can't believe it.

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.430
Kai...

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:49.850
He was successful.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:52.420
Kai has become the
ultimate member of Borg.

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:55.210
That's merely the first stage of the plan.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:58.190
Don't lose focus until we reach our end goal.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:59.150
Sir.

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:05.540
Kai...

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:11.300
I will make <i>your</i> Sacred
Beasts mine as well.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.920
Why...

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:26.160
Why did you have to..?!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:29.870
Kai!!!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:03.410
According to my analysis, it's time for
the second match with the Chinese team.

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:06.540
Kai alone will be their opponent again!

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:10.040
The three of them plan to battle him one at a time.

00:23:10.040 --> 00:23:13.560
We can't let Kai continue to go on his rampage!

00:23:13.560 --> 00:23:18.280
But what's waiting for us when we
sneak into the abbey to try and get him back?

00:23:18.280 --> 00:23:20.540
Next time: Goodbye, Kai.

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:24.960
There'll be 1,000,000 volts worth of shocking twists!
